WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.690
Lately, lots of people have been illegally downloading TV shows over the internet.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:13.670
Without the rights owner's permission, distribution via bootlegs is illegal.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.220
Please remember that!

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.680
Kenta, time to eat.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:28.750
Aren't you coming down to eat?

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.730
I'll just leave the food here.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:06.450
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:06.450
Miracles are right beside reality

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:09.540
Kanarazu aru

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:09.540
They're there for sure

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:20.890
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:20.890
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:26.800
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:26.800
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.740
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.740
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:38.920
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:38.920
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:40.330
Hitori janai

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:40.330
You're not alone

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:46.600
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:46.600
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:52.540
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:52.540
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:58.480
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:58.480
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:04.460
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:04.460
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:10.330
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:10.330
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:18.120
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:18.120
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.920
It hurts, it hurts!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.680
This is bad. She's going into shock!

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:47.030
Respiratory rate is dropping. Do a tracheotomy.

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:48.810
Pupils are dilating!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:52.020
Don't worry, that's a normal
occurrence after being electrocuted.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.060
Incising the right forearm. You take the left.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:55.900
Pulse rate is 142.

00:02:56.990 --> 00:03:00.180
This is the insulator suit we recovered.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:05.870
The charging lady who wore it suffered a substantial amount of burns due to electrocution.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:07.980
Based on the suit's forearm section...

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:11.220
....and damage to the ground wire,
we've come to one conclusion.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.590
This incident was caused by a backfeed effect.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.600
Backfeed effect?!

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.340
What's that?

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:21.820
Are you joking?

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.610
A backfeed effect:

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:29.750
This happens when one charges a target and the current flows in the opposite direction.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:33.740
If there's too much reverse flow,
the ground wire will get damaged.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.820
The suit's insulation can also be rendered ineffective.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:39.300
Thus, causing an incident like this one.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:44.530
How did you forget that...
You need to go back to training.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.570
Based on the results of the investigation,

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:54.240
a charging target that causes the backfeed possesses an unusually large amount of power themselves.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.460
This was the cause of the incident.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:59.710
Due to this, Neodym personnel have decided to classify this target...

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:04.970
...Kenta Kajiwara, a class Z.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.810
A target we can't do anything about, huh?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:11.220
They haven't appeared until recently...

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:12.370
A child?

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:18.180
As a result, this target will no
longer be considered for charging.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:20.730
Everyone must take notice of this change.

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:24.270
Especially the charging lady staff.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.540
It seems he was often bullied in the past.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:35.270
But after starting a new year, everyone was nice to him...

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:38.920
...and for a time, he was never bullied and enjoyed school.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:43.520
But then due to a slight misunderstanding,

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:46.120
he thought the bullying had started again.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:49.300
And because of that false happiness,

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.010
the resulting shock was horrible.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:53.800
He was still traumatized by the bullying...

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.580
...and he stopped coming to school,
even though he knew it was a misunderstanding.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:02.030
So that's the situation, huh?

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.630
What are you looking at?

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:12.000
Plug is actually studying?

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.820
The kid from the report?

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.960
It's a report on the class Z case.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:19.560
Plug said she wanted to see it.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:23.970
But she has no idea how to operate the document gallery.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.950
You should know how to do that by now!

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.160
Hey, that hurts!

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:32.430
But it makes you sad, doesn't it? He's still so young...

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.590
His official level is B.

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:39.650
It says here that when Division One first found him, he was a D!

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:42.860
That means he's getting worse, huh?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:47.360
And it seems he's getting worse at random times.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:53.620
"His condition is worsening and it may soon reach... level A"?!

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:56.230
How can that be?!

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:58.710
If he reaches A...

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:01.820
...couldn't his heart fail at any time?

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.350
Plug.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:08.050
Even with all that investigating,
do you really think you can do anything about it?

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:09.700
Even so...

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:12.310
I feel sorry for him!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.800
Is that really all?

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:18.290
After seeing the report, I've thought a little...

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.920
There might be... a way to save him...

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.510
You were thinking of doing that?

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:27.280
They told us not to charge a class Z at the meeting!

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.900
I saw this earlier.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:32.740
Look at this. It's how long our current suits would last.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.950
It says the maximum is five seconds.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.280
Five...

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.740
Any longer than that...

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:40.460
...and you'll end up like this.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:46.940
So, what if you charge him multiple times, five seconds each?

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:48.670
The estimation is here.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.050
You'd have to charge him 350 times.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:50.890
3...

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:55.720
If you do that, the parallel world's power transformer won't be able to withstand it.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.930
So that means it's impossible?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:03.900
You'll only have one shot if you decide to charge that kid.

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:08.860
You're putting your life at stake just by attempting it.

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:12.120
Stop thinking of doing such a crazy thing!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:16.580
He may be a troubling case,
but how could we possibly help him?

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:21.160
As your friend, I need you to know that you might not come back alive.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.710
Yeah...

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.970
Big news, everyone!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.970
I just heard from HQ!

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:46.190
Backfeed

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.190
Backfeed.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:54.240
See! I told you!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.040
Alesta, is that...?!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.850
The new suit model. What about it?

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.400
Is this for real?! Can you use it on a class Z?

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:05.460
Is it any more shock-resistant?

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:03.950
Don't touch me!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.710
The fists look like they can fly off like rockets!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:10.450
But why are you wearing this?

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:13.750
I am assigned to be in charge of the research...

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:16.570
...and I deemed Alesta to be capable of testing this.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:22.150
Alesta! I leave Kenta Kajiwara in your hands!

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:26.580
With this new suit, you'll most definitely be able to finish charging him in one shot!

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.420
I think you've got the wrong idea.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.240
Grand Break!

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.980
What are you doing, you idiot?!

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:51.740
What is that?

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:54.160
You seem to be out of it today.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:56.130
Really?

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:58.930
It's not the same.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:09.140
The purpose of this suit is not to save him.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:12.530
I'll be using it to gather data.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:14.660
Gather data?

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:15.780
What's going on?

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:20.070
A class Z is a very rare case. We'd like to gather as much info as possible about it.

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:23.500
Such as the readings that will output during the charge, amongst other things.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.350
This suit has been designed for that purpose.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.870
We've added a new glove model to a normal suit,

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:30.710
with three times the amount of electrical resistance...

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:35.760
It's not exactly foolproof but it'll collect the data we need.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.470
So what about the class Z?

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:41.220
Once the necessary data has been gathered, we'll stop charging the target.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:44.180
Wait, you're not going to follow through with him?

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.650
We've considered that.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:50.460
Even though the suit is designed to resist the backfeed,

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.150
we can't be completely sure that it's safe.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:55.140
But it's still possible, right?

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:57.440
If so, just charge him till completion.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:58.510
Plug.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:01.230
We should try, at the very least.

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.900
Let me do it, even if it's dangerous!

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:04.120
Stop it.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:06.930
But if this goes on, what will happen to Kenta?!

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:10.810
He's the one in danger as his depression level worsens!

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:12.900
We can only hope he fixes his problem.

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:15.150
So you'd let him die?!

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:16.900
Don't be stupid!

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:22.220
Our company isn't some charity organization! Stop it already!

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.400
But... but...

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:25.680
You should give up.

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.320
Captain.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.890
Alesta is right.

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.430
I can't anymore! At this rate...

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.270
Do I have to give up?

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:42.040
Have some pride!

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.610
But I can't win, no matter how hard I try!

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:46.030
He's on a completely different level!

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:49.800
I guess there's no choice, I'll teach you a special spell.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:50.860
"Special" spell?

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:54.500
That's right! "Special" like the bus you ride to school!

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.260
Why are you cleaning at this hour?

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:06.030
I'm attending a lecture tomorrow morning,
then I work at night, so now is the best time.

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:09.190
But isn't it enough to clean every other day?

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.650
Well, I do have the time now...

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:15.900
I don't like letting an opportunity slip away.

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:26.580
Hey, I'm going to vacuum that spot next...

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:39.100
"I don't like letting an opportunity slip away"...huh?

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.970
Bath time!

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:48.680
Sentou...

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.980
Hit me harder.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.730
Alesta here.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:00.950
Preparations for data collecting completed. Initiating spatial transfer.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:02.660
Understood.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.500
Transfer complete.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.000
Let's see...

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.840
The code for the new suit is...

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.720
Hold it right there!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.890
W-Who are you?!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.510
Plug!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.390
Why are you here?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:32.980
Well, there's a teeny-weeny favor I'd like from you...

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:35.480
What do you want from me?

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.440
Is performing a headlock part of the request?

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.070
Can you let me gather the data?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.150
Please, Alesta?!

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.660
Haven't I been a screw up in the eyes of the Captain lately?

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:48.330
So, my record has been below average!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.830
Just thinking of it mortifies me!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:53.870
In other words, you want to wear the new suit?

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.630
Yes, that's precisely what I mean!

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:59.880
You want to charge that boy up, right?

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:01.590
Not happening.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.300
Why?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.760
As long as the data is collected it doesn't matter who does it, right?

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.220
No means no!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.100
If I was to hand it over to an idiot like you,

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.020
who knows what would happen!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:17.150
Now, if you understand, hurry up and go back.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:22.490
You leave me no choice but to do this.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.740
What is it...?

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:26.950
Here it is!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.200
I knew it would work like a charm.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:38.420
If you think you can blackmail me twice, you'd better think again...

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.420
Pressing!

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:43.300
I'm just getting started, I can make it bigger!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:45.090
Watch this!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:52.140
Stop it! I don't want it to get bigger!

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.520
A few minutes later...

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.980
Sorry about that!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.100
Honestly...

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.190
I'll get your precious data!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.400
Make sure you do it right.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.530
What're you doing?

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.940
A strength check of the suit.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:07.070
It's just a precautionary procedure.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:07.740
What is this?!

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.450
These aren't the numbers in the report.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.540
Effectiveness against the backfeed effect...

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.620
...is 1.3 times higher.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.250
Shock resistance is 1.5 times higher?

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:22.250
It's almost the same as a normal suit!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.460
What are you saying?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.670
If you go and charge as you are now,

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:28.340
you can forget about your safety, it won't protect you at all.

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.430
What?!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.890
Seems we have no choice but to abort.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.810
How can that be?!

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.890
No way. If we don't charge now, then when?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.690
That will depend on the Research Department.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:44.280
To be honest, even if this thing was rushed,

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:45.030
they did a horrible...

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.610
I can't believe this!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.320
Plug?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:50.870
We don't have time for that!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:54.080
We don't know how much time is left before Kenta becomes an A!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:57.120
There's nothing we can do about it.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:57.830
But...

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:01.790
Have you forgotten? Our company is not a charity organization.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.670
Now, let's go back to HQ.

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.130
Give me the suit back.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.090
Plug?

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:12.850
Plug!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.560
Stop it, Plug!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:22.940
If the controls are the same as the original model...

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:29.110
The speed has increased, too.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.870
To infinity and beyond!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.290
Is that Kenta?

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.170
What are you looking at?

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.270
I see.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:13.030
Kenta, you really do want to go back to school.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.580
You want to go there and have fun.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.460
I understand.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.760
I don't care if the suit's the same!

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:33.550
I'm not afraid of any backfeed!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:34.640
Hold it!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:39.390
I'll do my best for your sake, Kenta!

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:44.900
Plug, stop it!

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.940
Fight in one strike.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.820
Charge!

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:51.820
CHARGING

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.120
Plug!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.340
<i>What is this?!</i>

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.840
<i>This pain! It burns!</i>

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.800
<i>It hurts!</i>

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:25.140
<i>I'm only... halfway...</i>

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:28.730
<i>The backfeed is too strong! I can't keep charging!</i>

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:31.190
Let go of the refresher, quick!

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.650
<i>Not yet. Not yet...</i>

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:38.870
Stop it! Your arms will burn up!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.120
Plug.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.840
Do your best... hang in there...

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:58.050
<i>Just a quarter to go!</i>

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:03.270
We only need to earn our pay!

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:07.230
Even if you save him, it'll be pointless if you die!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.900
<i>Just... a little more!</i>

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.400
You're going to die!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.160
Plug, you idiot!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:23.240
<i>Just a little more... I need to make it...</i>

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.710
<i>I'll make it... so you can...</i>

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.880
<i>...go outside and play again...</i>

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:35.880
<i>...and so you can... enjoy life...</i>

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.310
<i>Try harder...</i>

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:46.020
<i>Kenta...</i>

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:48.770
<i>Try harder...</i>

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:52.900
<i>Try harder...</i>

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:55.990
<i>Try harder...</i>

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:58.280
<i>Try harder...</i>

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:00.950
<i>Try harder...</i>

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.330
<i>Try harder...</i>

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.370
<i>Try harder...</i>

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:19.550
What's wrong?

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:23.680
Just now, I thought I felt something...

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:26.810
What am I saying?

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.110
We made it in time!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.360
Nice retrieval!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:43.580
Everyone... why?

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:47.540
There was an emergency dispatch request from the Captain.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.580
You just don't die, do you?

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:51.830
You're going to get one hell of a lecture later!

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:09.310
Medical!

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:12.520
We're now transporting one severely wounded person. We're counting on you!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.730
Really, why does she push herself this far?

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.940
Because... she's Plug.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.200
Because she's an idiot!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.990
Girls! Are you ready?

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.740
We need to initiate spatial transfer, quickly!

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.240
Roger!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.940
The new suit model was a complete failure.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:21:00.400
New suits are still just a pipe dream, I suppose.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.860
Well done, Plug.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:09.580
What's saves people's hearts is not technology...

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:13.330
...but the hearts of others, huh?

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:20.590
I hope the leakage ladies don't make a big deal out of this.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:23.420
Really.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:25.550
Even though it's supposedly an order,

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:28.050
is this kind of method really worth it?

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:52.200
Plug.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:57.580
Here, look at this.

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.670
This is the result of your recklessness!

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:06.130
I'm going to school tomorrow!

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:09.550
He's already gotten better.

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:11.600
That's why you need to get better, too!

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:16.060
The only good idiot is a headstrong one.

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:22.360
Plug...

00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:29.660
Plug!

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:39.210
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:39.210
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.000
Hitori demo heiki de

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:42.000
I'm fine even all by myself

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:44.800
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:44.800
I can go anywhere at all

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:47.550
Koibito nante iranai

00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:47.550
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:53.060
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:53.060
I decided that I would live strong

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:54.810
Kimi to deau made wa

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:54.810
Until the day I could meet you

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:02.820
Sore wa arigachi na

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:02.820
"That really is

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:05.610
Warui kuse da yo

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:05.610
It's a bad habit

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:08.360
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:08.360
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:11.160
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:11.160
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:16.330
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:16.330
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:19.460
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:19.460
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:21.210
Sore de nakya iya

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:21.210
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:25.000
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:25.000
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:33.050
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:29.130
I want to become the umbrella

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:33.050
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:38.600
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:35.970
But why is it that I'm the one

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:38.600
who always ends up being protected?

00:23:38.940 --> 00:23:44.900
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:23:38.940 --> 00:23:44.900
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:23:45.110 --> 00:23:49.610
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:23:45.110 --> 00:23:49.610
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:54.160
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:54.160
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.490
Itsumademo

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.490
Now and forever

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:59.710
Eien Sweetheart

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:59.710
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:06.550
Thank you for everything you've done, Plug.

00:24:06.550 --> 00:24:10.050
Every time I close my eyes, I can see it all flash before me.

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:11.010
The time we spent together...

00:24:11.010 --> 00:24:13.550
That beautiful, blissful and joyous time...

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:15.220
Oh, Alesta...

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:17.720
I never knew you cared so much for Plug...

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:20.440
Rest in peace, Plug!

00:24:21.520 --> 00:24:24.610
So let's pass the role of the heroine to me!

00:24:24.610 --> 00:24:26.610
That's what you're after!

00:24:26.610 --> 00:24:28.610
On the next episode of
Fight In one Strike! Charging Ladies!!:

00:24:28.110 --> 00:24:33.620
Maid in Alesta!

00:24:28.610 --> 00:24:30.150
Maid in Alesta!

00:24:30.150 --> 00:24:30.950
Maid?

00:24:30.950 --> 00:24:33.620
I have a bad feeling about this.
